                <text type="warning">Sheep graziers are warned that cold temperatures, rain and showers and westerly winds are expected during Sunday. Areas likely to be affected include the West Coast, Yorke Peninsula, Flinders, Mid North, Riverland and Murraylands forecast districts and parts of the Mount Lofty Ranges, Lower Eyre Peninsula, Eastern Eyre Peninsula, Kangaroo Island, North West Pastoral and North East Pastoral forecast districts. There is a risk of losses of lambs and sheep exposed to these conditions.</text>
